Subject: [PATCH] P5 integration: serve 33 P2-accepted heroes via existing
 catalogue-serving contract

Adds web/data/registry/p2-media-accepted.json (from P2 release P2-CATALOGUE-U11-2026-10-13-RC2,
branch claude/carindex-buyer-vehicle-data-97yinp) and 33 WebP heroes under web/public/media/p2/models/.
build-catalogue-release.mjs merges accepted.hero_image (optional input); release rebuilt with P5's own
script. Test: P2-accepted hero takes precedence over the P5 media registry. typecheck PASS; unit 61/61.

